[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6604.87, "timestamp": "01:50:04", "text": "さあ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6615.51, "timestamp": "01:50:15", "text": "ターゲットはまだ稼働中だ。 奴らを追跡して始末しろ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6630.229, "timestamp": "01:50:30", "text": "くそ。 医療従事者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6633.75, "timestamp": "01:50:33", "text": "医療従事者。 さあ、ブライトレイヴン。 あらら。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6637.83, "timestamp": "01:50:37", "text": "ああ、くそ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6638.55, "timestamp": "01:50:38", "text": "救急隊員が必要です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6641.99, "timestamp": "01:50:41", "text": "別の標的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6645.109, "timestamp": "01:50:45", "text": "2人が来る。   わかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6654.229, "timestamp": "01:50:54", "text": "任務完了には「追跡していない」というメッセージが必要ですが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6655.91, "timestamp": "01:50:55", "text": "、それでも状況を好転させることは可能です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6657.43, "timestamp": "01:50:57", "text": "。"}]